    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Serums Trio Bundle consists of 3 (Serums) (30ml)<\/p><ul><li>V34 Serum<\/li><li>HA5 Hyaluronic Serum <\/li><li>Enamel Care NH Pro Serum<\/li><li>Manual<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients (Gels)",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on Smile Therapy are:<strong> <\/strong><em><strong>100% Safe, Natural & Certified!<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p><em><strong>Enamel Care Serum:<\/strong><\/em><strong> <\/strong><br\/>Xylitol, Aqua\/Water,Dicalcium Phosphate Dihydrate,Disodium Phosphate, Glycerin, Hydroxyapatite (Nano), Cellulose Gum, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil,Potassium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol,Xanthan Gum, Stevioside, Theobromine, Ethylhexylglycerin.<\/p><p><em><strong>HA5 Hyaluronic Serum:<\/strong><\/em><strong><br\/><\/strong>Water\/Aqua, Glycerin, Xylitol, Betaine, Cellulose Gum, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate,<br\/>Phenoxyethanol,Sucralose, Ethylhexylglycerin,Sodium Phosphate<\/p><p><em><strong>V34 Serum:<br\/><\/strong><\/em>Glycerin, Aqua\/Water, Sorbitol, Hydrated Silica, Xylitol, Polysorbate 80, Cellulose Gum, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Sucralose, Tetrasodium, Pyrophosphate,CI17200\/D&C Red No.33,CI42090\/FD&C Blue No.1, Ethylhexylglycerin.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "792a2454-8dbe-40ac-ae87-a745eb01fb9b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's are the key ingredients of the Serums Trio Bundle",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Hydroxyapatite (Nano)<\/strong> (Enamel Care Serum) – Helps remineralise and strengthen tooth enamel by replacing lost minerals, crucial for enamel care and protection.<\/p><p><strong>Sodium Hyaluronate<\/strong> (HA5 Hyaluronic Serum) – A powerful hydrating agent that helps retain moisture in the gums and improves gum health, promoting oral tissue hydration.<\/p><p><strong>Hydrated Silica<\/strong> (V34 Serum) – A mild abrasive that powerfully removes surface stains from teeth, enhancing their brightness and overall appearance.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Caution",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on our website have been researched and tested thoroughly to ensure maximum safety of all our customers. <\/p><p>This product is not to be used while pregnant or breastfeeding.<\/p><p>This product is not recommended for those under the age of 12.<\/p><p>If residue from the gels is swallowed in small quantities please do not worry.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nbAPbH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Serums Trio Bundle be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Serums Trio Bundle is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings.  The V34, HA5, Enamel Care Serum is designed to safely whiten your natural teeth, it also helps to remove surface stains on dental restorations. The formula is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain intact while your smile is brightened.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
